# Shared look and pace for every demo. Each tape starts with `Source` of this.
#
# The pace is for reading, not for showing off: a command is typed at a
# readable speed and left on screen before Enter, and output stays up long
# enough to read. The docs embed these as videos with controls, so a reader
# can still pause; the README GIF cannot be paused at all.
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 75ms
Set CursorBlink false
